## 3) Retrieve / Show Image in Blade (No more “img not show”)

### ✅ Best way (Storage::url)

```blade
<img src="{{ $property->image ? Storage::url($property->image) : asset('assets/img/no-image.png') }}"
     alt="{{ $property->title }}"
     style="width:100%; height:220px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:14px;">
```

> `Storage::url('properties/abc.webp')` becomes: `/storage/properties/abc.webp`

✅ Works only when `php artisan storage:link` is done.

